e the regulatory bureau exercises its oversight.\"<|>\"jurisdictional authority, regional regulation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"宁夏回族自治区\"<|>\"宁夏回族自治区发展和改革委员会\"<|>\"The commission formulates economic policies specifically for the Ningxia region.\"<|>\"regional governance, policy development\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力直接交易\"<|>\"市场主体\"<|>\"Market entities participate in direct electricity trading activities.\"<|>\"market participation, transaction mechanism\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"合同电量转让交易\"<|>\"市场主体\"<|>\"Market entities engage in contract power transfer transactions.\"<|>\"contract flexibility, market activity\"<|>6)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market regulations, trading mechanisms, market entities, regulatory supervision\")<|COMPLETE|>"
