th adjustable floating ranges.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"峰谷电价\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Time-of-use pricing structure where direct transaction prices apply to flat periods while peak/valley rates follow existing ratios.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"宁夏发展改革委\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"The Ningxia Development and Reform Commission determines annual priorities and transaction scales that guide the Electricity Trading Institution's market operations.\"<|>\"regulatory oversight, market framework\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"The Electricity Trading Institution relies on security constraints from the Dispatch Institution for transaction clearing and coordinates for safety checks on results.\"<|>\"operational coordination, security management\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"基准电价+浮动机制\"<|>\"宁夏\"<|>\"This pricing model is implemented specifically for electricity market transactions within the Ningxia region.\"<|>\"regional policy implementation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"偏差电量处理\"<|>\"月度交易\"<|>\"Deviation handling mechanisms are applied to address imbalances arising from monthly electricity trading executions.\"<|>\"corrective mechanism, market balancing\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market, trading mechanisms, pricing models, regulatory compliance, deviation management\")<|COMPLETE|>"
