es, involving agreements for future electricity delivery.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"市场准入\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Refers to eligibility criteria for entities participating in electricity trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"强制退市\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Pertains to procedures for compulsory removal of entities from the market due to violations.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"甘肃省发展改革委\"<|>\"甘肃电力交易中心\"<|>\"The Development and Reform Commission guides the Trading Center in formulating annual plans and coordinates policy issues.\"<|>\"regulatory oversight, coordination\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国网甘肃省电力公司\"<|>\"甘肃电力交易中心\"<|>\"The Power Company collaborates with the Trading Center on settlement and technical support for market operations.\"<|>\"operational support, data management\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"甘肃电力交易中心\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"The Trading Center registers users, organizes trades, and manages their contracts.\"<|>\"market facilitation, registration\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"甘肃省电力市场管理委员会\"<|>\"电力中长期交易\"<|>\"The Committee studies and coordinates matters related to electricity trading rules.\"<|>\"rule governance, policy coordination\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"各市州发展改革委\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"Local development reform commissions organize user trading applications and monitor their electricity usage.\"<|>\"local administration, compliance monitoring\"<|>6)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market regulation, policy enforcement, market access, operational compliance\")<|COMPLETE|>"
