ystem breakdowns, or emergencies, involving measures like trading suspensions and price controls.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"省政府电力管理部门\"<|>\"These entities jointly supervise information disclosure, investigate market violations, and implement regulatory actions.\"<|>\"regulatory collaboration\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"They jointly release market information, coordinate during interventions, and ensure data supports market operations.\"<|>\"operational coordination\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"市场主体\"<|>\"The Bureau regulates market participants' compliance, handles violation investigations, and imposes penalties.\"<|>\"compliance enforcement\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省政府电力管理部门\"<|>\"青海省\"<|>\"This department exercises jurisdiction over electricity market governance within Qinghai Province.\"<|>\"regional governance\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"市场干预\"<|>\"The institution executes market interventions during crises and documents intervention details.\"<|>\"crisis management\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"market regulation, information disclosure, compliance enforcement, regional governance, crisis intervention\")<|COMPLETE|>"
