in the province.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"跨区跨省\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Refers to transactions involving electricity transfer between regions or provinces.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"集中交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A trading mechanism using uniform marginal clearing or high-low matching price formation; includes centralized bidding and rolling contract交易.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"双边协商交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"A trading mechanism based on direct negotiation between parties; generally not subject to price limits.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"安全校核\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Safety verification conducted by the电力调度机构 on pre-transaction results; takes 5 working days for annual trades and 2 for monthly trades.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"年度（多年）交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Annual or multi-year transactions for the following year(s), traded as total volume or time-divided volume; conducted via bilateral or centralized methods.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"月度交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Monthly transactions for the following month(s), traded as total volume or time-divided volume; conducted via bilateral or centralized methods.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"月内（多日）交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Intra-month or multi-day transactions for the remaining days or specific days of the month; conducted via bilateral or centralized methods.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"统一边际出清法\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A centralized clearing method using a single marginal price determined by the intersection of buyer/seller curves or an average if no intersection.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"高低匹配法\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A centralized clearing method matching highest buyer bids with lowest seller offers sequentially; transaction price is the average of the matched bids.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"基数电量\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Base electricity quantity allocated annually; not subject to capacity deduction for units with market contracts.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省政府电力管理部门\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"The department determines key annual electricity plans and scales, which the trading机构 implements and executes.\"<|>\"regulatory oversight, plan execution\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局派出机构\"<|>\"电力市场管理委员会\"<|>\"The committee proposes price limits, which are reviewed and approved by the administration's local offices.\"<|>\"price regulation, policy approval\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"The trading机构 relies on the dispatching机构 for security constraints and transmission capacity data to perform clearing and safety verification.\"<|>\"operational dependency, data sharing\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"集中交易\"<|>\"统一边际出清法\"<|>\"Uniform marginal clearing is one of the two defined methods for conducting集中交易.\"<|>\"trading mechanism, price formation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"集中交易\"<|>\"高低匹配法\"<|>\"High-low matching is one of the two defined methods for conducting集中交易.\"<|>\"trading mechanism, price formation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"可再生能源电力消纳\"<|>\"The trading机构 organizes renewable energy transactions and guides market participants to prioritize fulfilling their consumption responsibilities.\"<|>\"renewable integration, compliance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"年度（多年）交易\"<|>\"月度交易\"<|>\"Monthly trade results are aggregated with the monthly breakdown of annual trades by the trading机构 after safety verification.\"<|>\"temporal aggregation, result consolidation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省间交易\"<|>\"省内交易\"<|>\"Inter-provincial/regional trades are conducted before intra-provincial trades, with their results setting boundary conditions for省内交易.\"<|>\"transaction sequence, boundary setting\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"统一边际出清法\"<|>\"The actual purchase price for电力用户 under uniform marginal clearing includes the marginal price plus fees.\"<|>\"price calculation, cost components\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"发电企业\"<|>\"高低匹配法\"<|>\"The actual selling price for发电企业 under high-low matching is the transaction price.\"<|>\"price determination, revenue\"<|>6)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market, trading mechanisms, price format