 conduct agent purchasing listing transactions as defined in market rules.\"<|>\"market participation, agency role\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"甘肃省\"<|>\"电力中长期市场\"<|>\"Gansu Province's policies govern electricity market mechanisms including distributed photovoltaic pricing and transaction rules.\"<|>\"jurisdictional regulation, policy implementation\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"分时段交易\"<|>\"合约电量调整\"<|>\"Time-of-use trading enables adjustment of contract curves to reduce execution deviations.\"<|>\"operational flexibility, risk mitigation\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market mechanisms, trading rules, price formation, contract management\")<|COMPLETE|>"
