mpanies participating in the market.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Electricity consumers participating in the market.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"新型经营主体\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"New market entities including energy storage companies, virtual power plants, etc.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"批发用户\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Wholesale users who purchase electricity directly from the market.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"零售用户\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Retail users who purchase electricity through agents like electricity sales companies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"代理购电用户\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Users whose electricity purchasing is handled by grid enterprises.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力交易平台\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Technical support system for medium-to-long-term electricity markets.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Institution responsible for power grid dispatching.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"甘肃省\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Gansu Province, where these electricity market rules apply.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力中长期交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Transactions for electricity products or services to be delivered in future periods.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"优先发电电量\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Government-priced priority generation electricity treated as bilateral negotiated transaction volume.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"履约保障凭证\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Performance guarantee certificates required from some market participants.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"甘肃省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"中华人民共和国能源法\"<|>\"The implementation rules are formulated based on the Energy Law of China.\"<|>\"regulatory basis, legal framework\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"甘肃省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"中华人民共和国电力法\"<|>\"The implementation rules are formulated based on the Electricity Law of China.\"<|>\"regulatory basis, legal framework\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"甘肃省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"电力监管条例\"<|>\"The implementation rules are formulated based on Electricity Supervision Regulations.\"<|>\"regulatory basis, legal framework\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"甘肃省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"甘肃省\"<|>