er plants (aggregators) act as intermediaries, aggregating resources and managing retail service relationships.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"高耗能用户\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"High-energy-consuming users are identified by the provincial government department and have specific trading mechanisms.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"燃煤发电企业\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Coal-fired power generation enterprises participate in the market with trading mechanisms specified by national and provincial policies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"水电企业\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Hydroelectric power enterprises, except those supplying residential and agricultural users, fully participate in the electricity market.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"工商业用户\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Industrial and commercial users consume electricity purchased through inter-provincial transactions not covered by grid companies.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省内电力交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Intra-provincial electricity trading involves various mechanisms like annual, monthly, and intra-month transactions with specific rules.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省间市场\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The inter-provincial market is where entities participate after meeting intra-provincial electricity balance needs.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"年度交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Annual transactions involve trading electricity volumes for monthly and hourly periods in the coming year(s), conducted mainly through bilateral or centralized methods.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"月度交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Monthly transactions involve trading hourly electricity volumes for the upcoming month(s), held periodically.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"月内交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Intra-month trading includes weekly and daily rolling transactions for hourly electricity volumes from the next week or D+2 day onwards.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"日滚动交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Daily rolling trading operates continuously, clearing in real-time for D+2 day electricity volumes.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"绿电交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Green electricity trading occurs on a specific platform, requires project registration, and ensures traceability of environmental value.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"现货市场\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The spot market is referenced in relation to settlement rules for constrained generation and its linkage with medium to long-term trading.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"甘肃省政府主管部门\"<|>\"高耗能用户\"<|>\"The competent government department of Gansu Province determines the list of high-energy-consuming users.\"<|>\"regulation, user classification\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"甘肃省政府价格主管部门\"<|>\"电力市场管理委员会\"<|>\"The price department considers suggestions from the Electricity Market Management Committee when setting price caps and floors.\"<|>\"policy setting, advisory role\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"经营主体\"<|>\"The electricity trading institution releases trading calendars and announcements to market entities and organizes transactions.\"<|>\"market operation, information dissemination\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"The power dispatching agency provides grid constraint information and available generating capacity data to the trading institution.\"<|>\"data sharing, operational coordination\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"北京电力交易中心\"<|>\"绿电交易\"<|>\"Green electricity trading is conducted on the platform operated by the Beijing Power Exchange Center.\"<|>\"platform operation, specialized trading\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家可再生能源发电项目信息管理平台\"<|>\"绿电交易\"<|>\"Renewable energy projects must complete filing on this national platform before participating in green electricity trading.\"<|>\"precondition, market access\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"售电公司\"<|>\"经营主体\"<|>\"Electricity retail companies must establish retail service relationships with the market entities they represent.\"<|>\"representation, contractual relationship\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"虚拟电厂（聚合商）\"<|>\"经营主体\"<|>\"Virtual power plants (aggregators) establish aggregation service relationships with market entities.\"<|>\"resource aggregation, service provision\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"省内电力交易\"<|>\"省间市场\"<|>\"Market entities participate in the inter-provincial market only after fulfilling intra-provincial electricity balance requirements.\"<|>\"market sequence, balance prerequisite\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"年度交易\"<|>\"月度交易\"<|>\"Annual and monthly transactions are distinct but related components of the overall electricity trading framework.\"<|>\"trading hierarchy, temporal scope\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"月度交易\"<|>\"月内交易\"<|>\"Monthly and intra-month (weekly/daily) transactions form a continuum within the short-term trading structure.\"<|>\"temporal granularity, market segmentation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"绿电交易\"<|>\"数年绿电交易\"<|>\"Encouragement is given for participation in multi-year green electricity transactions to establish a regular trading mechanism.\"<|>\"market development, long-term contracts\"<|>6)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market regulation, trading mechanisms, policy framework, grid operations, renewable energy\")<|COMPLETE|>"
