ble energy tracking\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Contract Management\"<|>\"Measurement and Settlement\"<|>\"Contract execution relies on defined rules for measurement and periodic settlement processes.\"<|>\"contract fulfillment, financial processes\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Electricity Trading Agency\"<|>\"Information Disclosure\"<|>\"Manages the platform and processes for information disclosure as mandated.\"<|>\"data transparency, regulatory compliance\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Market Technical Support System\"<|>\"Electricity Trading Agency\"<|>\"Provides the essential technical platform (Electricity Trading Platform) for the agency's core functions.\"<|>\"technological infrastructure, operational support\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Electricity Regulatory Authority\"<|>\"Legal Responsibilities\"<|>\"Enforces legal responsibilities and penalties for violations of the market rules.\"<|>\"compliance enforcement, penalty administration\"<|>9)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"Electricity Market Regulation, Contract Management, Green Certificates, Risk Prevention, Dispute Resolution\")<|COMPLETE|>"
