 available generation capacity and trading limits.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"独立储能\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Independent energy storage participates in medium- and long-term trading as a single trading unit, with defined constraints on charging/discharging volumes and net purchase/sale limits.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"虚拟电厂\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Virtual power plants aggregate resources into trading units (node or ordinary electricity-selling types) for participating in market transactions, with trading limits based on aggregated resource types.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"北京电力交易中心\"<|>\"广州电力交易中心\"<|>\"Both Beijing and Guangzhou Electricity Trading Centers coordinate with provincial institutions for cross-regional market clearing.\"<|>\"market coordination, institutional collaboration\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"陕南\"<|>\"关中\"<|>\"Shaanxi South and Guanzhong are distinct regions used for calculating regional average utilization hours for new energy generation enterprises.\"<|>\"regional classification, utilization metrics\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"延安\"<|>\"榆林\"<|>\"Yan'an and Yulin are distinct regions used for calculating regional average utilization hours for new energy generation enterprises.\"<|>\"regional classification, utilization metrics\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"绿电交易\"<|>\"市场出清\"<|>\"Green electricity trading involves market clearing processes to ensure traceability of environmental value.\"<|>\"value traceability, transaction mechanism\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"新能源发电企业\"<|>\"独立储能\"<|>\"New energy generation enterprises with power-side energy storage combine their generation capacity with storage charging/discharging capabilities.\"<|>\"capacity integration, resource combination\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"虚拟电厂\"<|>\"独立储能\"<|>\"Virtual power plants include real-time controllable node energy storage trading units that follow independent energy storage trading rules.\"<|>\"trading unit classification, rule compliance\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|