ity market regulations.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"省政府电力主管部门\"<|>\"Jointly enforce market rules, investigate violations, impose penalties, and coordinate market interventions.\"<|>\"regulatory collaboration, enforcement\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力市场运营机构\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"Reports market activities, implements interventions, and provides data to the regulatory bureau as mandated.\"<|>\"operational compliance, supervision\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力市场运营机构\"<|>\"省政府电力主管部门\"<|>\"Submits reports and intervention records to provincial authorities and follows their directives during market interventions.\"<|>\"accountability, regulatory adherence\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力市场风险防控机制\"<|>\"市场干预\"<|>\"The risk prevention framework enables regulatory interventions during market emergencies to maintain stability.\"<|>\"risk management, contingency response\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"履约保障凭证\"<|>\"售电公司\"<|>\"Electricity retail companies are required to provide performance guarantee certificates as financial security.\"<|>\"compliance requirement, financial safeguard\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"履约保障凭证\"<|>\"虚拟电厂（聚合商）\"<|>\"Resource aggregators like virtual power plants must submit performance guarantees to ensure market participation compliance.\"<|>\"regulatory obligation, risk mitigation\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"market regulation, risk management, compliance enforcement, electricity trading, policy framework\")<|COMPLETE|>"
