city Trading Institution\"<|>\"Green Power Transactions\"<|>\"Establish green electricity traceability relationships based on contracts.\"<|>\"traceability services, contract execution\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Shaanxi Province Government\"<|>\"Risk Prevention Measures\"<|>\"Implements market intervention measures during emergencies.\"<|>\"market regulation, crisis management\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Energy Regulatory Agency\"<|>\"Shaanxi Province Government\"<|>\"Jointly handle market violations and dispute resolutions.\"<|>\"co-governance, legal enforcement\"<|>9)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market, regulatory framework, contract execution, settlement mechanisms, risk management\")<|COMPLETE|>"
