 Scheduling Institution\"<|>\"Coordinates for safety verification of trades and relies on scheduling data for market clearance.\"<|>\"coordination, regulatory compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Power Generation Enterprises\"<|>\"Electricity Trading Institution\"<|>\"Submit bids to the trading institution and adhere to its market rules.\"<|>\"market participation, regulatory adherence\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Electricity Retail Companies\"<|>\"Electricity Trading Institution\"<|>\"Participate in trading processes managed by the institution.\"<|>\"transactional engagement\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Annual Trading\"<|>\"Electricity Scheduling Institution\"<|>\"Requires scheduling data for transmission capacity constraints during trade execution.\"<|>\"operational dependency\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Monthly Trading\"<|>\"Deviation Electricity Handling Mechanism\"<|>\"Monthly trades are adjusted using deviation handling methods to correct imbalances.\"<|>\"trade adjustment\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"Market Entities\"<|>\"Renewable Energy Electricity Consumption Responsibility\"<|>\"Must commit to renewable energy consumption quotas when participating in trades.\"<|>\"regulatory obligation\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market, trading mechanisms, safety verification, regulatory framework, renewable energy responsibility\")<|COMPLETE|>"
