nsaction reduction follows time-cycle and attribute-based priorities when safety verification fails.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"西北电力交易机构\"<|>\"西北电力调度机构\"<|>\"They collaborate on safety verification processes, with trading institution submitting results and dispatching institution returning verification outcomes.\"<|>\"operational collaboration, regulatory process\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"西北电力调度机构\"<|>\"安全校核\"<|>\"The dispatching institution conducts safety verification according to jurisdictional scope and established principles.\"<|>\"procedural implementation, regulatory compliance\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"年度交易\"<|>\"月度交易\"<|>\"Annual transactions must be decomposed into monthly transactions with specified power allocations.\"<|>\"temporal decomposition, planning hierarchy\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"配套电源跨省交易\"<|>\"交易削减\"<|>\"Cross-province transactions for supporting power sources follow specific reduction priorities during transaction cuts.\"<|>\"priority management, contingency protocol\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"西北\"<|>\"配套电源跨省交易\"<|>\"The Northwest region serves as the operational context for organizing cross-province transactions of supporting power sources.\"<|>\"regional framework, jurisdictional scope\"<|>7)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity trading, safety management, regulatory framework, transaction scheduling, grid operations\")<|COMPLETE|>"
