    "content": "(\"entity\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Northwest Regulatory Bureau of the National Energy Administration drafted the 'Rules for Northwest Regional Cross-Provincial Medium-to-Long-Term Electricity Trading' and solicited public feedback.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"张惠渊\"<|>\"person\"<|>\"Zhang Huiyuan is the contact person for feedback submission, with provided phone number and email.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"陕西\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Shaanxi is one of the provinces participating in the Northwest Regional Cross-Provincial Medium-to-Long-Term Electricity Trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"甘肃\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Gansu is one of the provinces participating in the Northwest Regional Cross-Provincial Medium-to-Long-Term Electricity Trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"青海\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Qinghai is one of the provinces participating in the Northwest Regional Cross-Provincial Medium-to-Long-Term Electricity Trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"宁夏\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Ningxia is one of the provinces participating in the Northwest Regional Cross-Provincial Medium-to-Long-Term Electricity Trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"新疆\"<|>\"geo\"<|>\"Xinjiang is one of the provinces participating in the Northwest Regional Cross-Provincial Medium-to-Long-Term Electricity Trading.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西北区域跨省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"The 'Rules for Northwest Regional Cross-Provincial Medium-to-Long-Term Electricity Trading' is a regulatory document drafted to standardize electricity trading activities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"市场主体\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Market entities include power generation enterprises, grid companies, electricity retailers, electricity users, energy storage companies, etc., all with defined rights and obligations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"西北电力交易机构\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Northwest Power Trading Organization participates in rule-making, conducts cross-provincial electricity trading, manages transaction contracts, and operates trading platforms.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Power Dispatching Organization conducts safety checks, implements power dispatch, ensures grid stability, and collaborates with trading institutions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"北京电力交易中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The Beijing Power Exchange Center is referenced for its 'Inter-Regional and Inter-Provincial Medium-to-Long-Term Electricity Trading Rules'.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家发展改革委\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The National Development and Reform Commission (NDRC) issued multiple policy documents referenced as the basis for the rules.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"发电企业\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Power generation enterprises participate in trading, sign contracts, ensure grid access, follow dispatch orders, and disclose information.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Electricity users participate in trading, provide demand data, pay fees, follow dispatch orders, and comply with demand-side management.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"售电公司\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Electricity retailers participate in trading, sign contracts, disclose information, fulfill clean energy obligations, and possess technical capabilities.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网企业\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Grid companies ensure grid stability, provide services, operate technical systems, disclose information, collect fees, and fulfill clean energy obligations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"省（区）电力交易中心\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Provincial (Regional) Power Trading Centers support the Northwest Power Trading Organization in registration, transaction organization, settlement, and data provision.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"国家能源局西北监管局\"<|>\"西北区域跨省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"The Northwest Regulatory Bureau drafted and issued the rules for public consultation.\"<|>\"rule issuance, public consultation\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"西北区域跨省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"陕西\"<|>\"The rules apply to cross-provincial trading involving Shaanxi.\"<|>\"regulatory scope, geographical applicability\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"西北区域跨省电力中长期交易实施细则\"<|>\"甘肃\"<|>\"Th